{"name":"Safe Harbour","hex":"#1e8ea1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"safe harbour","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative form of safe harbor."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/safe_harbour"}],"entries":[{"title":"The O.C. season 3","blocks":[{"text":"The third season of The O.C. commenced airing in the United States on September 8, 2005, concluded on May 18, 2006, and consisted of 25 episodes. The first ten episodes of season three aired Thursdays at 8:00 p.m. ET in the United States on Fox; however, from January 12, 2006, onwards, The O.C. was shifted to a later time of Thursdays at 9:00 p.m. ET."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/53/The_O.C._Season_3_DVD_Cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_O.C._season_3"},{"title":"Tracey Gold","blocks":[{"text":"Tracey Gold is an American actress known for her role as Carol Seaver on the sitcom Growing Pains."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Tracey_Gold_2024.png/330px-Tracey_Gold_2024.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tracey_Gold"},{"title":"Safe Harbour (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Safe Harbour is a four-part Australian thriller drama series first broadcast on SBS on 7 March 2018. The series follows a group of friends who travel from Brisbane on a sailing holiday of a lifetime to Indonesia, who cross paths with a fishing boat overloaded with asylum seekers en route to Australia, which alters their lives forever."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/ce/SafeHarbourDVD.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Safe_Harbour_(TV_series)"},{"title":"Safe Harbour (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Safe Harbour is a 2007 American direct-to-video romantic drama film directed by Bill Corcoran, based upon the 2003 novel of the same name by Danielle Steel."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/1c/Safe_Harbour_DVD.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Safe_Harbour_(film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/c8/TheOCcast3.jpg/250px-TheOCcast3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c8/TheOCcast3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/c8/TheOCcast3.jpg/250px-TheOCcast3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Season 3 cast; from left to right: Julie, Marissa, Sandy, Kirsten, Ryan, Seth and Summer.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATheOCcast3.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Autumn_Reeser_by_David_Shankbone.jpg/500px-Autumn_Reeser_by_David_Shankbone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Autumn_Reeser_by_David_Shankbone.jpg/1280px-Autumn_Reeser_by_David_Shankbone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/Autumn_Reeser_by_David_Shankbone.jpg/500px-Autumn_Reeser_by_David_Shankbone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Autumn Reeser, who joined the cast as Taylor Townsend.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAutumn_Reeser_by_David_Shankbone.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}